with no side panels and 2 140mm front fans.", "like_count": 3, "author_id": "UChUSQzd5mlXo_m3uzeVkzeA", "author": "@TechteamGB", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_l5qZ0f-faXrJxwZw5RLFw6by9MKpOX0MUQAhU4XDcGghY=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": true, "author_is_verified": true, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@TechteamGB", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "5 years ago", "timestamp": 1604448000, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgwNhcZem2Ue-eIAjBF4AaABAg", "parent": "root", "text": "What do I think about the card? It is awesome and I would like to have one. But it is not available in my area. And Amazon doesn't ship one.", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UCbOGecte8nLmnWCGwV_yf0g", "author": "@ForzaE2", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nvge_Gy42RD5T8lpkFeQ5fL4PW6ITVnUf7HTfbMzfN_iA=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@ForzaE2", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "5 years ago", "timestamp": 1604448000, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "Ugyx9OGKq7pWYzw19Z14AaABAg", "parent": "root", "text": "that card cost more than my entire computer ... to make minecraft look like a xbox 360 game, RTX WIN YEA (pass)", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UCrxtGJn2Qw5yZZ29w-fHMIg", "author": "@osgeld", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mXGSt1LrE6C99892VKkJflGCOmJAwEnQYaLkKR4qo=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@osgeld", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "5 years ago", "timestamp": 1604448000, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgzIhG5UGfcbvEqDS9h4AaABAg", "parent": "root", "text": "I have the non super 2070 from them and like it. It has a white light which is OK but I understand them thinking no light might fit better since it can't be turned off. The cooler is quiet and performs well. \n\nThat being said, I paid $296 for the 2070 in July 2019 and regular price is kind of a meme when it comes to Turing IMO. I wouldn't have ever bought it without the crazy best buy clearance deal. I would wait for new GPUs and for reasonable performance per dollar gains.", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UC1u8BBMaE4MjJOBSdStndGw", "author": "@joeykeilholz925", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mO_7JkYmjHZS_dZy5S1AiIYpNam8hYO7FPr1Bu6X_6As80=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@joeykeilholz925", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "5 years ago (edited)", "timestamp": 1604448000, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgwDurduSV0f5geQx0h4AaABAg", "parent": "root", "text": "Would be great if you could also implement graphs for the thermals and how the overclocking is. + thermals when overclocked. 👍", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UCMJlaS70BPq7BeZBrxCAyuQ", "author": "@Pand0rasAct0r_", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/hAshC0-BeeKblEPsQW_-puPy5L5J2PajgvYL4ha4m-yNHzq7J9b21BMecl2WEvIRPhxDJdUC=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@Pand0rasAct0r_", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "5 years ago", "timestamp": 1604448000, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgyQuH81cpkpdIrSxoR4AaABAg", "parent": "root", "text": "So now Nvidia are pushing there RTX stocks...in this 3 days all youtubers that i follow are making system or reviwes on this cards...under why?! 😉", "like_count": 1, "author_id": "UC0H0CM8JP0Yud0bf98iYSng", "author": "@surpriseblueviana3803", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lUNcEkoGBf4Cba49ScVdR6VO4_AbMSVdjYY7er7pJo4A=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@surpriseblueviana3803", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "5 years ago", "timestamp": 1604448000, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgzN_MwmQDIGXXRoui14AaABAg", "parent": "root", "